---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_TAGLINE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';

const games = await getCollection('games');
const priorityOrder = ['roulette', 'ladder', 'balance', 'crocodile', 'cosmic-drop', 'gem-2048'];
const sortedGames = games.sort((a, b) => {
  const idxA = priorityOrder.indexOf(a.id);
  const idxB = priorityOrder.indexOf(b.id);
  return (idxA !== -1 ? idxA : 99) - (idxB !== -1 ? idxB : 99);
});
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko" class="dark">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title={`${SITE_TITLE} - ${SITE_TAGLINE}`} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
  </head>
  <body class="arcade-home-body">
    <Header />

    <main class="arcade-home-main">
      <!-- Hero Section -->
      <section class="hero-showcase">
        <div class="hero-backdrop"></div>
        <div class="hero-content">
          <div class="hero-pill">
            <span class="pill-spark">🔴</span>
            <span>치지직(CHZZK) · 유튜브 라이브 · SOOP 방송 도구</span>
          </div>

          <h1 class="hero-headline">
            생방송의 긴장감을 극대화하는<br />
            <span class="gradient-text">무료 방송용 인터랙티브 도구 모음</span>
          </h1>

          <p class="hero-subtext">
            야식 추첨 돌림판, 커피 내기 사다리타기, 저챗 밸런스 게임, 악어 복불복까지! 설치 없이 OBS 브라우저 소스로 즉시 띄워 방송 텐션을 끌어올리세요.
          </p>

          <!-- Featured Game Hero Banner -->
          <div class="featured-hero-card">
            <div class="featured-glow"></div>
            <div class="featured-inner">
              <div class="featured-badge-row">
                <span class="flagship-badge">🔥 실시간 인기 방송 도구</span>
                <span class="rating-badge">★ 4.99 (45.2K회 사용)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="featured-main-row">
                <div class="featured-icon-box">🎡</div>
                <div class="featured-text">
                  <h2>방송용 돌림판 룰렛</h2>
                  <p>실제 회전 물리 엔진, 찰진 래칫 눈금 틱 사운드, 승자 폭죽 이펙트와 야식/벌칙 1초 프리셋 지원.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="featured-action">
                  <a href="/games/roulette" class="btn-play-hero">
                    <span>🎡 룰렛 돌리기</span>
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Games Showcase Grid -->
      <section class="games-directory-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="title-group">
            <span class="sec-label">ALL TITLES</span>
            <h2>Choose Your Challenge</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="sec-desc">Every game runs directly on your device CPU with zero lag, instant loading, and zero installations.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="games-grid">
          {sortedGames.map(game => (
            <article class={`game-card ${game.data.featured ? 'featured-card' : ''}`}>
              <div class="card-top-row">
                <span class="card-icon">{game.data.icon}</span>
                <div class="card-badges">
                  <span class="category-pill">{game.data.category}</span>
                  <span class="badge-accent">{game.data.badge}</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="card-body">
                <h3 class="card-title">
                  <a href={`/games/${game.id}`}>{game.data.title}</a>
                </h3>
                <p class="card-tagline">{game.data.tagline}</p>
                <p class="card-description">{game.data.description.substring(0, 130)}...</p>
              </div>

              <div class="card-footer">
                <div class="meta-row">
                  <span class="meta-item">⏱️ {game.data.playTime}</span>
                  <span class="meta-item">👥 {game.data.players}</span>
                </div>
                <a href={`/games/${game.id}`} class="btn-play-card">
                  <span>Play Now →</span>
                </a>
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Why StreamArcade Section -->
      <section class="value-props-section">
        <div class="props-grid">
          <div class="prop-card">
            <div class="prop-icon">📺</div>
            <h3>OBS 브라우저 소스 100% 호환</h3>
            <p>프로그램 설치 없이 URL만 복사하여 OBS 스튜디오 브라우저 소스에 붙여넣으면 깔끔한 크로마키/오버레이로 즉시 방송에 띄울 수 있습니다.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="prop-card">
            <div class="prop-icon">📱</div>
            <h3>PC & 모바일 완벽 지원</h3>
            <p>PC 단축키(Space, 숫자키)와 스마트폰 터치 인터페이스를 모두 지원하여 생방송 중 끊김 없이 조작할 수 있습니다.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="prop-card">
            <div class="prop-icon">🔒</div>
            <h3>100% 무료 & 개인정보 수집 제로</h3>
            <p>회원가입, 로그인, 유료 결제가 일절 없으며 모든 데이터는 브라우저 내부에서 안전하게 실행됩니다.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- FAQ Section -->
      <section class="home-faq-section">
        <div class="faq-container">
          <span class="faq-tag">자주 묻는 질문</span>
          <h2>스트리머 FAQ</h2>
          <div class="faq-grid">
            <div class="faq-box">
              <h3>OBS Studio에서 어떻게 띄우나요?</h3>
              <p>OBS 소스 목록에서 [+] 버튼을 누르고 [브라우저]를 추가한 뒤, 원하는 게임 페이지 URL(예: /games/roulette)을 입력하세요. 너비 1280, 높이 720으로 설정하시면 방송 화면에 완벽하게 표시됩니다.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-box">
              <h3>회원가입이나 결제가 필요한가요?</h3>
              <p>아닙니다! 스트림아케이드는 100% 무료이며 로그인이나 회원가입 없이 모든 방송 도구를 평생 무료로 사용하실 수 있습니다.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-box">
              <h3>치지직(CHZZK), SOOP, 유튜브 모두 지원하나요?</h3>
              <p>네! 웹 브라우저 기반으로 동작하므로 치지직, SOOP(아프리카TV), 유튜브 라이브, 트위치 등 모든 방송 플랫폼에서 완벽하게 작동합니다.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-box">
              <h3>사다리타기나 룰렛 결과는 조작이 불가능한가요?</h3>
              <p>네, 모든 난수는 브라우저의 암호학적/물리 엔진 알고리즘에 의해 실시간으로 생성되므로 100% 공정합니다.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .arcade-home-body {
    background: #090d16 !important;
    color: #f1f5f9 !important;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .arcade-home-main {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1rem 5rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* Hero Section */
  .hero-showcase {
    position: relative;
    padding: 3rem 1rem 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-backdrop {
    position: absolute;
    top: -30%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 650px;
    height: 450px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.22) 0%, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1) 50%, transparent 80%);
    filter: blur(60px);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35);
    color: #e9d5ff;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .hero-headline {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .gradient-text {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a855f7 0%, #38bdf8 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .hero-subtext {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  /* Featured Hero Card */
  .featured-hero-card {
    position: relative;
    background: #0f172a;
    border: 2px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    text-align: left;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
  }

  .featured-badge-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .flagship-badge {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444, #f97316);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .rating-badge {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #facc15;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .featured-main-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .featured-icon-box {
    font-size: 3rem;
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3);
    border-radius: 14px;
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .featured-text {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .featured-text h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #f8fafc;
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
  }

  .featured-text p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .btn-play-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a855f7 0%, #38bdf8 100%);
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-play-hero:hover {
    transform: scale(1.04);
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.5);
  }

  /* Games Grid */
  .games-directory-section {
    margin: 3rem 0;
  }

  .section-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .sec-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #38bdf8;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #f8fafc;
    margin: 0.2rem 0 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .sec-desc {
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .games-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .game-card {
    background: #0f172a;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .game-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .game-card.featured-card {
    border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35);
  }

  .card-top-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
  }

  .card-badges {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .category-pill {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    color: #94a3b8;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .badge-accent {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
    color: #38bdf8;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0 0 0.2rem;
  }

  .card-title a {
    color: #f8fafc;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .card-title a:hover {
    color: #38bdf8;
  }

  .card-tagline {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #38bdf8;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  }

  .card-description {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .card-footer {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding-top: 0.85rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .meta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .btn-play-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-play-card:hover {
    background: #38bdf8;
    color: #020617;
  }

  /* Value Props */
  .value-props-section {
    margin: 4rem 0;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    background: #0f172a;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .props-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .prop-card {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .prop-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .prop-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #f8fafc;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .prop-card p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* FAQ */
  .home-faq-section {
    margin: 4rem 0 2rem;
  }

  .faq-inner {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .home-faq-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #f8fafc;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .faq-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .faq-box {
    background: #0f172a;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .faq-box h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #f8fafc;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .faq-box p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-headline {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
    }
    .featured-main-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .props-grid, .faq-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .btn-play-hero {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>